@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@customerId = 8a533ea3-b804-474c-9460-b799c928cd02

### Process liveness (anonymous)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### SQL readiness (anonymous)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### OpenAPI (Development only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/swagger/v1/swagger.json

### Get a seeded customer
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/customers/{{customerId}}
X-Api-Key: {{$processEnv REFERENCE_API_KEY}}

### Replace the display name
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/customers/{{customerId}}/display-name
X-Api-Key: {{$processEnv REFERENCE_API_KEY}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "displayName": "Northwind" }

### Validation error
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/customers/{{customerId}}/display-name
X-Api-Key: {{$processEnv REFERENCE_API_KEY}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "displayName": " " }

### Missing key
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/customers/{{customerId}}
